# Sulphur Vent's vent pools (CIPlay sulphur_vent_acid; in a test world 'CI ...'). Since 11-18 (w16I) the two pools are
# sea-filled hollows on the low east flats: pool A (acid zone sv_poolA at 26 10, r 3, safe=suit) on the diggers' path
# (16.5 10 to the Diggers' crate at 37 10), pool B (sv_poolB at 26 -10) on the samplers' path (to the Samplers' tin at
# 37 -10). Each path's bypass runs round the pool's outer shelf (z 17 / z -17). Without a suit: through each pool hurt;
# round each by the shelf unhurt; a chest at each end.
# (11-17 w16: a tick while leaving a pool counts, so the check after walking out is `expect hurt 0`, which resets it)
island Sulphur Vent keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm

empty
at 16.5 10 h=6
read DIGGINGS PATH
picture sv_poolA 16.5 +2.5 10 26 +0 10
walk 16.5 10 to 26 10
wait 5
expect message vent pool
expect hurt 4
walk 26 10 to 16.5 10
wait 2
expect hurt 0
walk 16.5 10 to 20 17 to 32 17 to 35.5 10
wait 3
expect unhurt
open Diggers' crate
wait 2
expect item MetalOre 2
walk 35.5 10 to 32 17 to 20 17 to 16.5 10 to 16.5 -10
read SAMPLERS' PATH
picture sv_poolB 16.5 +2.5 -10 26 +0 -10
walk 16.5 -10 to 26 -10
wait 5
expect message vent pool
expect hurt 4
walk 26 -10 to 16.5 -10
wait 2
expect hurt 0
walk 16.5 -10 to 20 -17 to 32 -17 to 35.5 -10
wait 3
expect unhurt
open Samplers' tin
wait 2
expect item CopperIngot 1
